          "items": [
            "This is a NEW property, never rented! Don't miss out! <br><br>Sandy Toes, is the perfect 30A Luxury escape where every detail has been thoughtfully curated for an unforgettable beach vacation. <br><br>The Ultimate Beach package<br><br>Complimentary with your stay<br>* 4 passenger LSV (street legal golf cart)<br>*(3) Adult beach cruiser bicycles, (2) youth beach cruiser bicycles w/locks/helmets<br>*(8) Beach chairs<br>* Beach bags<br>* Beach umbrellas<br>* Beach wagon, toys and towels<br>* Everything needed for perfect beach days<br><br>Elegant Living Space<br><br>This stylishly appointed townhome features:<br>* Spacious great room with 70\" LG Smart TV<br>* New main seating with Queen size sleeper sofa<br>* Elegant Coastal dining table with seating for 6<br>* Additional seating at the Kitchen Island<br>* Gourmet kitchen with stainless steel appliances and quartz countertops<br><br>Premium Sleeping Arrangements (Sleeps 8): <br><br>* Owner's retreat with King bed, Smart TV, walk in closet and luxury en-suite<br>* King bedroom with Smart TV<br>* Third bedroom with twin over full bunk beds with Smart TV<br>* Pack & Play with sheets <br><br>Additional Amenities<br><br>* Two car garage<br>* Keyless smart entry<br>* Fully equipped laundry room in the home<br>* Outdoor security monitoring for peace of mind. <br>Please be advised that outdoor security cameras are installed at the driveway, back deck and entrance to the door. These cameras are in place to ensure the safety and security of our property.<br><br>Our comprehensive Welcome Book guides you to the best nearby beach access points, local dining gems and must-visit attractions to ensure your 30A experience is truly exceptional.<br><br>Experience \"Big Chill\" vibes at the community's large resort style pool w/zero entry, just moments away from your door. Sandy Toes is directly across from the North pool. The North pool is heated in March-April and October-November. Sandy Toes is perfectly positioned hear the beach in sought-after Prominence.<br><br>Check out THE BIG CHILL/HUB! Directly across the street from our community. <br><br>We really hope you will consider renting Sandy Toes for your next great vacation. It's a very beautiful and serene place to be! Come check us out. You'll be glad you did.<br><br>***VERY IMPORTANT*** <br>NO third party bookings permitted. <br><br>When submitting a reservation request, please make sure to monitor your VRBO account for our response. We will respond back to you immediately. We do require that our guests openly communicate with us as we do our best to provide top notch host-guest communications.<br><br>ADDITIONAL RENTAL NOTES<br>The Main renter must be at least 25 years of age, must provide the Host with the names and ages of everyone in their party and must be staying at the home for the entire duration of the reservation. They must be willing to provide the Host with a copy of their valid driver’s license, up-to-date full-coverage auto insurance card, and email address within 24 hours of booking acceptance. The Main renter will also be required to sign the Legal Rental Agreement and Liability Waivers.<br><br>Any additional guests who wish to drive the LSV (low-speed vehicle) must also be at least 25 years of age—no exceptions—and must provide a copy of their valid driver’s license, up-to-date full-coverage auto insurance card, and email address within 48 hours of booking acceptance and will be required to sign the Legal Liability Waivers.<br><br>No parties are permitted at Sandy Toes. This includes bachelorette, bachelor parties or gatherings. Sandy Toes is a family oriented property. <br><br>No animals are permitted in the home in order to prevent damage and protect guests with severe allergies. Thank you for your understanding.",
